{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762560/extras/53c910821748b59c6dc0d3b9d75da879.avif?t=1599827990\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>Simple to play, as the new generation of digital card games, and strategic as traditional ones. Discover the world of ManaRocks and its unique <u>features</u>:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Seasonal Card Game<br>On SCGs, the set of cards changes every season, creating a new experience and always changing meta for the players. Everyone starts each season with the same basic cards and unlocks the remaining through playing and evolving. A real Free to Play game, no Booster Packs no Loot Boxes.<br><br></li><li> 2v2 Co-Op Game Mode <br>You can play with your friend or with a random partner in epic matches. Use the same battlefield with your partner and explore your creativity to create synergies and combos between your decks.<br><br></li><li> New Rewards Each Season<br>Earn new customize and collectibles rewards each Season. New Heroes, card backs, emotes and more!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/762560?t=1599827990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/762560?t=1599827990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762560/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1599827990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762560/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1599827990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>New Seas